I like the tonal range on this overall.  Good story line.  I think the boat could have been played up a little more in the composition.  Processing-wise I''m seeing some ghosting on the horizon, not a lot, but some.  The house / farm in the upper far right is kind of interesting.  Accidental perhaps, but would have been fun to make that more intentional as well (perhaps with less of the scene on the left?).  Anyway, good luck.  Was one of my top picks.</td>', 'I like the tonal range on this overall.  Good story line.  I think the boat could have been played up a little more in the composition.  Processing-wise I''m seeing some ghosting on the horizon, not a lot, but some.  The house / farm in the upper far right is kind of interesting.  Accidental perhaps, but would have been fun to make that more intentional as well (perhaps with less of the scene on the left?).  Anyway, good luck.  Was one of my top picks.', '2025-10-30 16:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
